n', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Brassil', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a0bf98a4-d6af-5b5c-bed0-054dc0fdf999', 'word_count': 1231, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0bf98a4-d6af-5b5c-bed0-054dc0fdf999'}, {'abstract': 'Even with a visa cap increased, the pandemic’s disruption has left a dearth of landscapers, crabbers and restaurant help.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/02/business/economy/seasonal-foreign-guest-workers.html', 'snippet': 'Even with a visa cap increased, the pandemic’s disruption has left a dearth of landscapers, crabbers and restaurant help.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SALT LAKE CITY — Tyler Holt summed up the problem his Utah landscaping business faces every year. “People who want to be in the job force want stability — if they want to work, they work full time,” he said. “Locally there’s just no workers who want to do anything seasonal.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/business/00seasonal-03/merlin_192005892_241b3216-79aa-42ed-810d-e020b861839e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/03/business/00seasonal-03/merlin_192005892_241b3216-79aa-42ed-810d-e020b861839e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/business/00seasonal-03/merlin_192005892_241b3216-79aa-42ed-810d-e020b861839e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/business/00seasonal-03/merlin_192005892_241b3216-79