g to work are in flux as employers confront questions of privacy, health and safety. We’re curious to know your thoughts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As millions of Americans prepare to return to their jobs in person, many employers are scrambling to implement health and safety protocols in the workplace, whether that is an office, on the front lines, or anywhere else. Reporters for The New York Times writing about these policies would like to hear from workers about their experiences. (And throughout the pandemic, millions of workers never left their workplaces. We’re interested in hearing from people returning to non-office or office-support jobs, too. Please share your experiences here.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/multimedia/30workers-callout-1/30workers-callout-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/30/multimedia/30workers-callout-1/30workers-callout-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/multimedia/30workers-callout-1/30workers-callout-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/multimedia/30workers-callout-1/30workers-callout-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/multimedia/30workers-callout-1/30workers-callout-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/30/mul