stead of federal legislation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/03/us/politics/biden-voting-rights.html', 'snippet': 'Dozens of groups criticized what they see as a misguided White House strategy that focuses on organizing instead of federal legislation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dozens of voting rights groups and left-leaning get-out-the-vote organizations said on Tuesday that they were sending a letter to the Biden administration demanding more aggressive action to pass federal voting legislation. The letter also criticizes what the groups perceive as a misguided White House strategy that puts too much emphasis on organizing — the grass-roots work of registering, educating and turning out voters — to combat dozens of new voting restrictions passed by Republicans across the country this year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/us/politics/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/03/us/politics/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/us/politics/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/us/politics/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden/03political-briefing-voting-rights-biden-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp