89590b633', 'word_count': 590, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5cb3386b-5e53-5dc5-88e3-08989590b633'}, {'abstract': 'After growing disillusioned with the board he had run, he became, a colleague said, “a vocal critic of the arbitrary and arcane parole system.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/03/nyregion/robert-dennison-dead.html', 'snippet': 'After growing disillusioned with the board he had run, he became, a colleague said, “a vocal critic of the arbitrary and arcane parole system.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Dennison, a former chairman of the New York State Parole Board who became a powerful champion of wrongfully convicted or remorseful inmates in high-profile cases, died on July 26 at a hospital in Manhattan. He was 75.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/04/obituaries/03dennison1-sub/merlin_192557883_4582154d-d907-4105-8989-28f52ef8c6c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/04/obituaries/03dennison1-sub/merlin_192557883_4582154d-d907-4105-8989-28f52ef8c6c3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/04/obituaries/03dennison1-sub/merlin_192557883_4582154d-d907-4105-8989-28f52ef8c6c3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/04/obituaries/03dennison1-sub/merlin_192557883_4582154d-d907-4105-8989-28f52ef8c6c3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2