ituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/34dd23ad-feed-5923-99e4-1a63643e013d', 'word_count': 949, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34dd23ad-feed-5923-99e4-1a63643e013d'}, {'abstract': 'The White House said it supported the effort, and a restaurant trade group in the city said the rules could stave off new shut down orders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/03/nyregion/covid-vaccine-mandate-restrictions.html', 'snippet': 'The White House said it supported the effort, and a restaurant trade group in the city said the rules could stave off new shut down orders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reactions were largely supportive of vaccine restrictions imposed Tuesday by Mayor Bill de Blasio of New York City, the most stringent steps announced recently in any major U.S. city, though some health experts suggested they might not go far enough. Workers and customers in New York will soon have to provide proof that they have received at least one vaccine dose before engaging in activities like indoor dining, exercising in gyms and seeing performances, Mr. de Blasio said on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/lens/03virus-briefing-nyc-reax/merlin_192559047_84611e1b-2817-453e-bc5d-c44e71208e3f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/03/lens/03virus-briefing-nyc-reax/merlin_192559047_84611e1b-2817-453e-bc5d-c44e71208e3f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/lens/03virus-briefing-nyc-reax/merlin_192559047_84611e1b-2817-453e-bc5d-c44e71208e3f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2