Rachel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e6d170d7-f483-5422-ab0a-93fb4d9b7f36', 'word_count': 698, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e6d170d7-f483-5422-ab0a-93fb4d9b7f36'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 4, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/03/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-first-gold-in-wrestling-for-a-black-woman.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 4, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Oh, my gosh, look at us representing. And I’m like: If one of us wins, we’re making history. You’re making history, I’m making history, we’re making history.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: First Gold in Wrestling for a Black Woman', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-04T02:08:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/d29c4a11-97b9-5ca8-9e03-362ea079deaf', 'word_count': 52, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d29c4a11-97b9-5ca8-9e03-362ea079deaf'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Wednesday, Aug. 4, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/03/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-4-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Wednesday, Aug. 4, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Tuesday about the allocation of funds in President Biden’s $1 trillion infrastructure bill misstated the amount of money Mr. Biden had sought to try to bring high-speed internet access to every American. It was $100 billion, not $100 million. The article also misstated the amount the bill would spend on restoring the Great Lakes. That figure is $1 billion, not $1 million.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 4, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-04T02:15:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/f7f1a1d3-dd46-5f6b-b1ea-9ce716c1447c', 'word_count': 161, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f7f1a1d3-dd46-5f6b-b1ea-9ce716c1447c'}, {'abstract': '东京奥运每日精彩瞬间：8月3日', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2021/08/03/universal/zh/83.html', 'snippet': '东京奥运每日精彩瞬间：8月3日', 'lead_paragraph': '东京奥运每日精彩瞬间：8月3日', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/sports/03COVER1/03COVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/03/sports/03COVER1/03COVER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/sports/03COVER1/03COVER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/sports/03COVER1/03COVER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/03/sports/03COVER1/03COVER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT