-of-the-day-bronze-wasnt-goal-until-it-was-and-now-its-a-joy.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, August 6, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Everyone wants to get a gold medal, Americans love golds. The fact is we potentially didn’t deserve to get a gold medal. We had to change the goal, and it became, ‘Let’s get that bronze.’”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Bronze Wasn’t Goal Until It Was, and Now It’s a ‘Joy’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-06T04:44:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/9dc25f74-9922-5f8d-ac28-7e59e9f45c75', 'word_count': 52, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9dc25f74-9922-5f8d-ac28-7e59e9f45c75'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 6, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/06/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-6-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 6, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Thursday about the Squirrel Comedy Theater misstated the name of an annual event held by the Upright Citizens Brigade. It is the Del Close Marathon, not the Del Close Festival.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 6, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Correction', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-06T04:44:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/e805