administration officials are taking a new tack.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/06/health/covid-booster-shot-immunocompromised.html', 'snippet': 'Worried about a vulnerable population as the Delta variant surges, administration officials are taking a new tack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Food and Drug Administration is speeding efforts to authorize extra doses of the coronavirus vaccines for Americans with weakened immune systems, a change that reflects a growing concern within the Biden administration about these vulnerable patients as the contagious Delta variant surges nationwide.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/science/06virus-immuno-1/merlin_192798558_267026b8-a056-4df2-9de8-096b1839da62-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/06/science/06virus-immuno-1/merlin_192798558_267026b8-a056-4df2-9de8-096b1839da62-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/science/06virus-immuno-1/merlin_192798558_267026b8-a056-4df2-9de8-096b1839da62-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/science/06virus-immuno-1/merlin_192798558_267026b8-a056-4df2-9de8-096b1839da62-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/science/06virus-immuno-1/06virus-immuno-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan