alifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'LaFraniere', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/461649cb-b5cf-577c-8671-867b53d336d6', 'word_count': 1243, 'uri': 'nyt://article/461649cb-b5cf-577c-8671-867b53d336d6'}, {'abstract': 'The study is the first real-world test of the vaccine’s efficacy against Delta, a highly contagious variant of the virus surging across the United States and much of the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/06/science/johnson-delta-vaccine-booster.html', 'snippet': 'The study is the first real-world test of the vaccine’s efficacy against Delta, a highly contagious variant of the virus surging across the United States and much of the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A single dose of the Covid-19 vaccine made by Johnson & Johnson is highly effective in preventing severe illness and death from the Delta and Beta variants of the coronavirus, data from a clinical trial in South Africa suggest.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/us/06virus-briefing-JNJ-vax-SWAP/merlin_187652349_3e19dc4d-a5aa-462d-b510-a37766b47ffa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/06/us/06virus-briefing-JNJ-vax-SWAP/merlin_187652349_3e19dc4d-a5aa-462d-b510-a37766b47ffa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/06/us/06virus-briefing-JNJ-vax-SWAP/merlin_187652349_3e19dc4d-a5aa-462d-b510-a37766b47ffa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt