f78-9b93-99f8adfd3e01'}, {'abstract': "Broadcasting religious worship has played an important role during the pandemic. But it's had unintended consequences.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/08/opinion/covid-church-livestream.html', 'snippet': "Broadcasting religious worship has played an important role during the pandemic. But it's had unintended consequences.", 'lead_paragraph': 'Riding around town earlier this year, my 3-year-old daughter shouted, “Look, a church!” It took me a second to understand what she meant. I didn’t see any churches. All I could see was a parking deck. Then I realized my daughter couldn’t remember our church building. Since last summer our church has been meeting under the cover of a parking deck so that we could still assemble in person without wilting in Alabama’s summer sun.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/10/opinion/10hansen-inyt/08hansen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/10/opinion/10hansen-inyt/08hansen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/10/opinion/10hansen-inyt/08hansen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/10/opinion/10hansen-inyt/08hansen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/10/opinion/10hansen-inyt/10hansen-inyt-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 't