mes.com/2021/08/08/opinion/opioid-epidemic-sacklers-settlement.html', 'snippet': 'After years of dithering and a surge in overdose deaths, we have an administration that seems able to distinguish between effective and ineffective approaches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been more than two decades since Purdue Pharma released its patented pain medication OxyContin to an unsuspecting public. Since then, more than 500,000 people have died in the United States in an addiction and overdose crisis triggered by the excessive marketing and overuse of that drug and others like it. Thousands of lawsuits have been filed against Purdue and other opioid makers, but for the most part only small-time scapegoats — street dealers and opioid users — have truly been held to account for the epidemic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/09/opinion/09interlandi_illo/09interlandi_illo-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/09/opinion/09interlandi_illo/09interlandi_illo-articleLarge-v6.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/09/opinion/09interlandi_illo/09interlandi_illo-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/09/opinion/09interlandi_illo/09interlandi_illo-superJumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/09/opinion/09interlandi_illo/09interlandi_illo-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height'