bstract': 'In 2003, our writer absorbed the rapper’s message of individual triumph. But in a new moment of collective action, it’s time to write new rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/09/arts/jay-z-black-album.html', 'snippet': 'In 2003, our writer absorbed the rapper’s message of individual triumph. But in a new moment of collective action, it’s time to write new rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In my senior year of high school, I joined the student council. I knew that it might look fishy — adding on another extracurricular so late in the game — but I figured making the effort could also work in my favor. I imagined eagle-eyed college admissions officers poring over my file, spotting any latent passions discovered in the heat of application season. Half amused, they would scribble their verdict in the margins: “Shameless but hungry.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/arts/00summer-jayz/00summer-jayz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 449, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/11/arts/00summer-jayz/00summer-jayz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 449}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/arts/00summer-jayz/00summer-jayz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/arts/00summer-jayz/00summer-jayz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1533, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/arts/00summer-jayz/00summer-jayz-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'