actly that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/09/dining/vegetarian-cooking-newsletter.html', 'snippet': 'The world of vegetarian cooking is vast and diverse, and our new newsletter celebrates exactly that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'By trade, I’m an omnivore. The only food rule I follow is that I eat everything, because anything can lead to deliciousness. Maybe it’s goat meat on the bone, cooked low and slow and served in a dark pool of its own cooking juices. Maybe it’s a bloomy wheel of cheese made from cashew milk, dense and creamy in the middle. If it’s good, I want it, and then I want seconds.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/dining/09VEGGIE1/merlin_188546805_0b68c138-a032-463b-bd10-a8ef5fd56039-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Endless Pleasures of Vegetarian Cooking', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For the Vegetarian in You, and Me', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetarianism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-09T17:20:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tejal Rao', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tejal', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rao', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2ba98b11-9f5a-5a29-b853-9c060cd1a730', 'word_count': 903, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2ba98b11-9f5a-5a29-b853-9c060cd1a730'}, {'abstract': 'Defense Secretary Lloyd J. Austin III said he will issue the order once the F.D.A. has fully approved the vaccine. If that hasn’t occurred by mid-September, he may seek to do it anyway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/09/us/politics/vaccine-mandate-military-covid.html', 'snippet': 'Defense Secretary Lloyd J. Austin III said he will issue the order once the F.D.A. has fully approved the vaccine. If that hasn’t occurred by mid-September, he may seek to do it anyway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Pentagon will seek to make