5919038f157', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42b86096-4c67-5e3c-a930-85919038f157'}, {'abstract': 'The F.D.A. needs to speed up approval of coronavirus jabs for children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/09/opinion/covid-vaccine-children-fda.html', 'snippet': 'The F.D.A. needs to speed up approval of coronavirus jabs for children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few weeks ago I posted, on Twitter, that I was increasingly furious with the F.D.A. for taking so long to authorize Covid vaccines for children under 12. Then I deleted the tweet, because I know that as desperate as I am to get my kids inoculated, I’m not qualified to make judgments about how the F.D.A. collects safety data.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/opinion/12goldberg-new-inyt/09goldberg-new-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/12/opinion/12goldberg-new-inyt/09goldberg-new-articleLarge-v4.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 679}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/opinion/12goldberg-new-inyt/09goldberg-new-jumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 906, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/opinion/12goldberg-new-inyt/09goldberg-new-superJumbo-v4.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1811, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/opinion/12goldberg-new-inyt/09goldberg-new-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbn