 who participated this week, and congratulations to our winner, Peri Ferguson, as well as our many runners-up and honorable mentions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/10/learning/summer-reading-contest-winner-week-7-on-black-valedictorians-and-the-toxic-trope-of-black-exceptionalism.html', 'snippet': 'Thank you to the teenagers who participated this week, and congratulations to our winner, Peri Ferguson, as well as our many runners-up and honorable mentions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We received 1,021 entries from students from around the world for the seventh week of our 10-week Summer Reading Contest. Thank you to everyone who participated, and congratulations to our winner, Peri Ferguson, as well as the runners-up and honorable mentions we recognize below.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27Getachew-articleLarge.png', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27Getachew-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27Getachew-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27Getachew-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1600, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27Getachew-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/06/27/opinion/27Getachew/27G