ations that led most of his allies to abandon him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo of New York said on Tuesday that he would resign from office, succumbing to a ballooning sexual harassment scandal in an astonishing reversal of fortune for one of the nation’s best-known leaders.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cuomo Resigns Amid Scandals, Ending Decade-Long Run in Disgrace', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cuomo to Quit in Harassment Scandal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sexual Harassment', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Hazards and Violations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Governors (US)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hochul, Kathleen C', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Letitia', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': '#MeToo Movement', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-10T16:32:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Luis Ferré-Sadurní and J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Luis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ferré-Sadurní', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'org