ytimes.com/2021/08/11/world/asia/indonesia-army-virginity-tests.html', 'snippet': 'Women in the army have been subjected for decades to a procedure that has been condemned as pseudoscientific and a violation of human rights.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Indonesian Army will stop subjecting female recruits to mandatory vaginal exams, the army chief said in an interview with local reporters this week. Rights groups have long viewed the procedure as a continuation of the invasive and discredited so-called virginity test that is slowly being stamped out in many places.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/07/world/07xp-indonesia/merlin_162156429_c500ff45-b920-441e-86b3-3dc25aac2d35-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/07/world/07xp-indonesia/merlin_162156429_c500ff45-b920-441e-86b3-3dc25aac2d35-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/07/world/07xp-indonesia/merlin_162156429_c500ff45-b920-441e-86b3-3dc25aac2d35-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/07/world/07xp-indonesia/merlin_162156429_c500ff45-b920-441e-86b3-3dc25aac2d35-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/07/world/07xp-indonesia/07xp-indonesia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/07/world/