ect', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wildfires', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tebboune, Abdelmadjid', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALGERIA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-11T17:19:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivian Yee and Massinissa Benlakehal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yee', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Massinissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benlakehal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f59b1e0b-1960-5017-bb46-99af315d3871', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f59b1e0b-1960-5017-bb46-99af315d3871'}, {'abstract': 'In “Four Thousand Weeks,” a self-help book skeptical of self-help, Oliver Burkeman offers perspective on how we might spend the fleeting time that we get.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/11/books/review-four-thousand-weeks-time-management-oliver-burkeman.html', 'snippet': 'In “Four Thousand Weeks,” a self-help book skeptical of self-help, Oliver Burkeman offers perspective on how we might spend the fleeting time that we get.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Always somewhat nervously punctual, I have now advanced to the point where I prefer to get to the airport a solid three hours early, allowing for a meal, cocktail and some uninterrupted reading time. This has transformed an experience that once induced anxiety into actual leisure. I’m not, as you might infer from this fact, someone who likes to wring as much productivity as I can from each day.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 848, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 848}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1210, 'width': 856, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/books/review/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1/07BOOKBURKEMAN-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Life Is Short. What Are You Going to Do About That?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Life’s a Leaky Boat: Just Plug the Biggest Holes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'na