mandates have gained momentum among both public and private employers as cases have jumped across the country with the spread of the Delta variant.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/11/us/california-teachers-vaccine-mandate.html', 'snippet': 'Similar mandates have gained momentum among both public and private employers as cases have jumped across the country with the spread of the Delta variant.', 'lead_paragraph': 'California became the first state to issue a vaccine mandate for all educators in public and private schools on Wednesday when Gov. Gavin Newsom ordered teachers and school staff members to provide proof of vaccination against Covid-19 or face weekly testing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/world/11virus-briefing-california-teachers/merlin_186189732_d70426ba-0bdc-4a3a-a83e-39772198c5f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 411, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/11/world/11virus-briefing-california-teachers/merlin_186189732_d70426ba-0bdc-4a3a-a83e-39772198c5f7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 411}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/world/11virus-briefing-california-teachers/merlin_186189732_d70426ba-0bdc-4a3a-a83e-39772198c5f7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 701, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/11/world/11virus-briefing-california-teachers/merlin_186189732_d70426ba-0bdc-4a3a-a83e-39772198c5f7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1401, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',