ools are understaffed with nurses. Here’s why, and how to fix the problem.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/12/opinion/nurses-understaffing-covid.html', 'snippet': 'Hospitals, nursing homes and schools are understaffed with nurses. Here’s why, and how to fix the problem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Covid-19 pandemic exposed strengths in the nation’s health care system — one of the greatest being our awesome nurses. But it also exposed many weaknesses, foremost among them being chronic nurse understaffing in hospitals, nursing homes and schools.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion/14Aiken-3-inyt/merlin_176051619_1bca8750-64c9-47b4-b13f-536a48f1ec21-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion/14Aiken-3-inyt/merlin_176051619_1bca8750-64c9-47b4-b13f-536a48f1ec21-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion/14Aiken-3-inyt/merlin_176051619_1bca8750-64c9-47b4-b13f-536a48f1ec21-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion/14Aiken-3-inyt/merlin_176051619_1bca8750-64c9-47b4-b13f-536a48f1ec21-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion/14Aiken-3-inyt/11Aiken-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/14/opinion