er discussed the sensitivities of the assignment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Mark Abramson, a freelance photographer based in New York and Los Angeles, saw the news of the condominium tower collapse in Surfside, Fla., on June 24 that killed 98 people, he started looking at cross-country flights. He didn’t have an assignment from any publication, but he knew he needed to be in the town, a suburb of Miami, to document what was happening to the community.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/12/pageoneplus/12a2_itt/merlin_192113172_68f87f57-a683-41ae-856a-47715a2f6862-thum