2021/08/12/business/retirement/pandemic-retirees.html', 'snippet': 'A significant portion of workers who left their jobs since the coronavirus began surging were financially unprepared, research shows.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andrea Jones hadn’t yet settled on a date to retire from her customer service job at United Airlines when Newark airport started looking like a ghost town in March 2020. After 28 years with the carrier, she still loved her work. But by the end of that month, she had hung up her blue uniform for the last time. She is still struggling with a sense of loss.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/business/11Retiring-Forced-Jones/merlin_193078806_a6d20544-4d2f-414c-a223-ab720c7be2a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/15/business/11Retiring-Forced-Jones/merlin_193078806_a6d20544-4d2f-414c-a223-ab720c7be2a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/business/11Retiring-Forced-Jones/merlin_193078806_a6d20544-4d2f-414c-a223-ab720c7be2a8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/business/11Retiring-Forced-Jones/merlin_193078806_a6d20544-4d2f-414c-a223-ab720c7be2a8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/business/11Retiring-Forced-Jones/merlin_193078806_a6d20544-4d2f-414c-a223-ab720c7be2a8-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid