e brought passion and nuance — and a love for blues music — to his award-winning study of the marginalized and the oppressed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/12/us/leon-litwack-dead.html', 'snippet': 'One of Berkeley’s most popular professors, he brought passion and nuance — and a love for blues music — to his award-winning study of the marginalized and the oppressed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leon Litwack, a leather-jacket-wearing, blues-loving historian whose pioneering books on slavery and its aftermath demonstrated how Black people thought about and shaped their own liberation, even as they were constrained by racism in American society, died on Aug. 5 at his home in Berkeley, Calif. He was 91.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/obituaries/14Litwack-print1/merlin_193105599_08a495fd-40a8-42ce-a047-e75cae1fe30c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/14/obituaries/14Litwack-print1/merlin_193105599_08a495fd-40a8-42ce-a047-e75cae1fe30c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/obituaries/14Litwack-print1/merlin_193105599_08a495fd-40a8-42ce-a047-e75cae1fe30c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/obituaries/14Litwack-print1/merlin_193105599_08a495fd-40a8-42ce-a047-e75cae1fe30c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1128, 'width': 1912, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/14/obituari