ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/41479a55-140a-5b27-b441-d99bd21ee42c', 'word_count': 1050, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41479a55-140a-5b27-b441-d99bd21ee42c'}, {'abstract': 'The census was hobbled by the coronavirus and by a White House that tried to take undocumented immigrants out of the count to shift the balance of power.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/12/us/census-data-pandemic-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The census was hobbled by the coronavirus and by a White House that tried to take undocumented immigrants out of the count to shift the balance of power.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps no census has been as fraught as the one that led to the data released on Thursday, a count pummeled by the pandemic and hobbled by a White House that sought to use it as a tool to permanently shift the balance of national political power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/us/12census-briefing-history/merlin_174806751_039c0c51-30c6-4f9d-8a2e-8c1c0f47ae2e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/12/us/12census-briefing-history/merlin_174806751_039c0c51-30c6-4f9d-8a2e-8c1c0f47ae2e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/us/12census-briefing-history/merlin_174806751_039c0c51-30c6-4f9d-8a2e-8c1c0f47ae2e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/12/us/12census-briefing-history/merlin_174806751_039c0c51-30c6-4f9d-8a2e-8c1c0f47ae2e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac