5-39e5ddc5beaa'}, {'abstract': 'The insect, found in New Zealand, has an evolutionary trick that supports its bizarre and elongated head.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/13/science/meet-the-giraffe-weevil-its-got-a-secret-up-its-long-snout.html', 'snippet': 'The insect, found in New Zealand, has an evolutionary trick that supports its bizarre and elongated head.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The greatest jousting competitions in the world can be found on certain rotting trees in the New Zealand bush, where hordes of males compete for the opportunity to mate. The knights are not humans but New Zealand giraffe weevils, a species of beetle with a snout like a lance. The biggest males snout-wallop each other until the other either retreats or is knocked unceremoniously from the bark.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/13/science/13tb-giraffe-weevil2/merlin_193128360_7063de29-e90e-48c3-8e39-7cd4e74dc0c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/13/science/13tb-giraffe-weevil2/merlin_193128360_7063de29-e90e-48c3-8e39-7cd4e74dc0c1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/13/science/13tb-giraffe-weevil2/merlin_193128360_7063de29-e90e-48c3-8e39-7cd4e74dc0c1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/13/science/13tb-giraffe-weevil2/merlin_193128360_7063de29-e90e-48c3-8e39-7cd4e74dc0c1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'c