 {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 13, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/13/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-13-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 13, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Wednesday about the death of Julissia Batties misidentified the relative with whom she went to live last year. It was her mother, Navasia Jones, not her grandmother, Yolanda Davis.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 13, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-13T04:23:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ec0f1ec-8218-5dd3-b1d8-6212336e32f1', 'word_count': 191, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ec0f1ec-8218-5dd3-b1d8-6212336e32f1'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, August 13, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/13/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-amid-a-pandemic-and-repression-a-boy-band-changes-the-mood.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Friday, August 13, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Suddenly, they’ve realized that they could put down all these so-called big social things. There is something more joyful, playful, that draws them away from the political impasse of their youth.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Amid a Pandemic and Repression, a Boy Band Changes the Mood', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-13T04:24:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_