cle/86bed2c5-bb86-54c8-b68a-3ca27ee8c12d'}, {'abstract': 'The internet’s obsession with Bennifer may tell us more about ourselves than about the superstar couple.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/13/podcasts/ben-affleck-jennifer-lopez-bennifer.html', 'snippet': 'The internet’s obsession with Bennifer may tell us more about ourselves than about the superstar couple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jennifer Lopez and Ben Affleck first started dating in 2002, then broke up after a brief engagement. This summer found both celebrities newly (and briefly) single, and — as photos of kisses at restaurants, on yachts and on J. Lo’s own Instagram confirmed — passionately reunited. “Bennifer” is yet again the portmanteau of the moment. They’re the couple of the summer. And the internet can’t get enough.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ben Affleck and Jennifer Lopez are Back Together, and We Can’t Look Away', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Relationships', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Affleck, Ben', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lopez, Jennifer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Celebrities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-13T09:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dodai Stewart, Michael Gold, Anna Martin, Hans Buetow, Theo Balcomb, Phyllis Fletcher and Corey Schreppel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dodai', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stewart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gold', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', '