0040-5854-9cac-2698049aed47', 'word_count': 887, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e9298a50-0040-5854-9cac-2698049aed47'}, {'abstract': 'Lale Gul’s autobiographical and sexually frank tale of a woman breaking with her conservative Muslim culture, and her strict parents, is a best seller in the Netherlands. “I’m done hiding,” she says.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/13/world/europe/netherlands-dutch-turkish-novelist.html', 'snippet': 'Lale Gul’s autobiographical and sexually frank tale of a woman breaking with her conservative Muslim culture, and her strict parents, is a best seller in the Netherlands. “I’m done hiding,” she says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AMSTERDAM — Perhaps naïvely, Lale Gul thought she could continue living with the same people on whom she had based her best-selling novel: her strict Turkish-Dutch migrant family.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/07/22/world/00SaturdayProfile-LaleGul-01/merlin_190119969_e492425c-6f57-4540-bdbf-da830b88a944-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/07/22/world/00SaturdayProfile-LaleGul-01/merlin_190119969_e492425c-6f57-4540-bdbf-da830b88a944-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/07/22/world/00SaturdayProfile-LaleGul-01/merlin_190119969_e492425c-6f57-4540-bdbf-da830b88a944-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/07/22/world/00SaturdayProfile-LaleGul-01/merlin_190119969_e492425c-6f57-4540-bdbf-da830b88a944-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name