839'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Biden’s statement came hours after the Taliban seized Mazar-i-Sharif but before it captured the eastern city of Jalalabad and entered Kabul on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/15/world/asia/before-the-fall-of-kabul-biden-defends-his-decision-to-leave-afghanistan.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Biden’s statement came hours after the Taliban seized Mazar-i-Sharif but before it captured the eastern city of Jalalabad and entered Kabul on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the Taliban on the verge of regaining power in Afghanistan, President Biden has defended his decision to leave the country after two decades of U.S. military involvement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/world/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/15/world/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/world/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/world/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 1285, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/15/world/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03/15afghanistan-briefing-bide-03-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop