': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/89f2c9c7-3181-5b93-9040-ba3cc241c97e', 'word_count': 862, 'uri': 'nyt://article/89f2c9c7-3181-5b93-9040-ba3cc241c97e'}, {'abstract': 'The actor, who’s set to play the controversial Uber co-founder Travis Kalanick in an upcoming series, thinks the tech takeover may be a good thing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/16/opinion/sway-kara-swisher-joseph-gordon-levitt.html', 'snippet': 'The actor, who’s set to play the controversial Uber co-founder Travis Kalanick in an upcoming series, thinks the tech takeover may be a good thing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt is deep in Silicon Valley these days. No, he’s not pitching a start-up (though he does have one of those): He is playing Uber’s former chief executive Travis Kalanick in an upcoming Showtime anthology series. And while Gordon-Levitt has some thoughts about society’s “deification of technology,” he is relatively bullish on Silicon Valley and the trend of tech companies taking over Hollywood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1619, 'width': 1619, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/opinion/16sway-gordon-levitt/16sway-gordon-levitt-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt: ‘Silicon Valley Now Owns Hollywood’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'audio-neutral-informative', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Silicon Valley (Calif)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gordon-Levitt, Joseph', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple TV', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kalanick, Travis', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-16T09:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': "By ‘Sway'", 'person': [{'firstname': "Sway'", 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c51345d0-0b36-59f1-b856-56462955a024', 'word_count': 203, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c51345d0-0b36-59f1-b856-56462955a024'}, {'abstract': 'Last year, the court ruled 5 to 4 that much of the state is an Indian reservation. Oklahoma wants a do-over, testing the court’s respect for the power of precedent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/16/us/supreme-court-native-americans-oklahoma.html', 'snippet': 'Last year, the court ruled 5 to 4 that much of the state is an Indian reservation. Oklahoma wants a do-over, testing the court’s respect for the power of precedent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The precedent, which ruled that much of eastern Oklahoma falls within an Indian reservation, is just over a year old. A couple of weeks ago, Oklahoma asked the Supreme Court to overrule it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/politics/16dc-bar/merlin_193144557_2c8dc056-937c-4576-bb01-105ed6200c17-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/us/politics/16dc-bar/merlin_193144557_2c8dc056-937c-4576-bb01-105ed6200c17-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/politics/16dc-bar/merlin_193144557_2c8dc056-937c-4576-bb01-105ed6200c17-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/politics/16dc-bar/merlin_193144557_2c8dc056-937c-4576-bb01-105ed6200c17-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/politics/16dc-bar/merlin_193144557_2c8dc056-937c-4576-bb01-105ed6200c17-thumbStan