_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/16/world/australia/indigenous-australians-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'With the Delta variant spreading, only 15 percent of Indigenous people over the age of 16 have been fully inoculated, well behind the national level, according to officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the Delta variant of the coronavirus spreads beyond Sydney into the surrounding state of New South Wales, concern is mounting about the potential impact on vulnerable, unvaccinated Aboriginal Australians.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-australia/merlin_193328232_fed965d6-64b4-41e1-80c6-dc833af562e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-australia/merlin_193328232_fed965d6-64b4-41e1-80c6-dc833af562e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-australia/merlin_193328232_fed965d6-64b4-41e1-80c6-dc833af562e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 654, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-australia/merlin_193328232_fed965d6-64b4-41e1-80c6-dc833af562e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1307, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-australia/16virus-briefing-australia-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-aust