steer the Southeast Asian country through its worst wave of the virus yet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/16/world/asia/Muhyiddin-Yassin-resigns.html', 'snippet': 'Prime Minister Muhyiddin Yassin will stay on until a successor is appointed, continuing to steer the Southeast Asian country through its worst wave of the virus yet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Battered by public anger over the Malaysian government’s handling of the coronavirus and acknowledging he had lost the support of lawmakers, Prime Minister Muhyiddin Yassin and his entire cabinet resigned on Monday, signaling an end to a tumultuous 17-month reign.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-malaysia-prime-minister-sub/merlin_193326297_fccec237-1dcb-41e0-886c-7a75128ca64a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-malaysia-prime-minister-sub/merlin_193326297_fccec237-1dcb-41e0-886c-7a75128ca64a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-malaysia-prime-minister-sub/merlin_193326297_fccec237-1dcb-41e0-886c-7a75128ca64a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-malaysia-prime-minister-sub/merlin_193326297_fccec237-1dcb-41e0-886c-7a75128ca64a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/world/16virus-briefing-malaysia-prime-minist