eley, a ranch house in Los Angeles and a three-bedroom townhouse in Hermosa Beach.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This house was designed by Eldridge Theodore Spencer, a local architect, as a home and theatrical studio for Merle Marston, the daughter of a prominent Berkeley family and a teacher of dance and acting. Details in the home reflect its dual purpose: A door leading from the kitchen to the stage (now a dining area) is frameless, creating the illusion of a solid wall, and there is a passageway from a front hall closet to the bathroom to facilitate costume changes during performances. Woven into the design are hand-painted florals by Mr. Spencer’s wife, Jeanette Spencer, a painter whose murals can be seen at the Ahwahanee hotel, in Yosemite National Park, also designed by Mr. Spencer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/realestate/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/realestate/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/realestate/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/realestate/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/realestate/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O/16WYG-CA-slide-SK6O-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 