/article/3a3a057b-b0f4-5f1d-8418-29f94d3208a9'}, {'abstract': 'Many of those who worked alongside U.S. troops have waited years for visas to come to the United States. The speedy withdrawal of forces left most of them behind.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/16/us/afghanistan-visa-refugees-us.html', 'snippet': 'Many of those who worked alongside U.S. troops have waited years for visas to come to the United States. The speedy withdrawal of forces left most of them behind.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tens of thousands of Afghan nationals risked their lives to assist the United States military in Afghanistan, many of them working as interpreters alongside American soldiers in combat. Now, after the Taliban’s takeover, they are more desperate than ever to leave — but swift, safe passage to the United States may prove elusive.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/16visa-explainer-1/merlin_193320756_76e1b28a-9a53-489a-a8ab-e2b4e92abcec-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/16/us/16visa-explainer-1/merlin_193320756_76e1b28a-9a53-489a-a8ab-e2b4e92abcec-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/16visa-explainer-1/merlin_193320756_76e1b28a-9a53-489a-a8ab-e2b4e92abcec-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/16/us/16visa-explainer-1/merlin_193320756_76e1b28a-9a53-489a-a8ab-e2b4e92abcec-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype':