 'nyt://article/5bea1ed3-0e0e-5f16-93a2-a9a5b8a62ea2'}, {'abstract': 'Shakespeare in the Park is back, and Dede Ayite’s West African-influenced costume designs are just as lively as Jocelyn Bioh’s adaptation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/17/theater/merry-wives-costumes-dede-ayite.html', 'snippet': 'Shakespeare in the Park is back, and Dede Ayite’s West African-influenced costume designs are just as lively as Jocelyn Bioh’s adaptation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Saheem Ali, the director of this summer’s Shakespeare in the Park production of “Merry Wives,” thought about which costume designer he wanted to create the clothes for the show, he knew immediately that it should be Dede Ayite. The two have been friends for years, and have worked together on “Twelfth Night” for the Public Mobile Unit, “Fires in the Mirror” at Signature Theater Company and the upcoming “Nollywood Dreams” at the MCC Theater.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/arts/16merry-costumes1/merlin_190752237_31b30fb3-2dda-4d2c-a393-51744b8b1391-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 573, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/18/arts/16merry-costumes1/merlin_190752237_31b30fb3-2dda-4d2c-a393-51744b8b1391-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 573}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/arts/16merry-costumes1/merlin_190752237_31b30fb3-2dda-4d2c-a393-51744b8b1391-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 979, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/arts/16merry-costumes1/merlin_190752237_31b30fb3-2dda-4d2c-a393-51744b8b1391-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1957, 'width': 2048,