 the foothills of the Blue Ridge Mountains, a shingled house in Madison and a 1912 Tudor-Craftsman in San Francisco.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/18/realestate/home-prices-north-carolina-connecticut-california.html', 'snippet': 'A 1947 home on 18 acres in the foothills of the Blue Ridge Mountains, a shingled house in Madison and a 1912 Tudor-Craftsman in San Francisco.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This house, known as Rosebay, is in a historic resort community of about 1,600 in southwest North Carolina. It was expanded, starting in 2015, with the addition of a guest suite and a detached two-car garage with a workshop. Other recent improvements include a paved driveway that replaces gravel, and a new roof.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/realestate/18WYG-slide-BZQE/18WYG-slide-BZQE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '$1.25 Million Homes in North Carolina, Connecticut and California', 'kicker': 'What You Get', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Tryon (NC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison (Conn)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-18T13:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Lasky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lasky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a650432-c444-5735-a7d3-4a428380faf4', 'word_count': 1143, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a650432-c444-5735-a7d3-4a428380faf4'}, {'abstract': 'A face made of meteorite adds an alien element to a time-tested design.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/18/t-magazine/rolex-watch-cosmograph-daytona.html', 'snippet': 'A face made of meteorite adds an alien element to a time-tested design.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the turn of the 19th century, Western culture became fascinated with meteors and other astronomical phenomena. Around the same time, two men working 800 miles apart — the Austrian printer Count Alois von Beckh Widmanstätten and Guglielmo Thomson, an English mineralogist based in Naples — made a similar discovery: If one treats a split-open iron-based meteorite with a mild nitric acid solution, a strikingly intricate crystalline grid emerges. Today, the motif is referred to as the Widmanstätten patterns or the Thomson structures, but no matter who gets credit, they are among nature’s most hypnotic creations. Rolex, the Swiss watchmaker, has used meteorite for its dials in the past, backing thin slices of it with brass, but now, the company has reimagined its iconic Cosmograph Daytona with a face made from a solid slab of chemically treated fallen star. Encased in rose gold, white gold or yellow gold (as pictured), the etched surface lends the famously sophisticated timepiece an otherworldly patina — literally — that practically lifts it into the stratosphere. Rolex Cosmograph Daytona, $41,000, rolex.com.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '102', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/t-magazine/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy/19tmag-rolex-slide-CCI5-copy-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Watch From Outer Space', 'kicker': 'The Thing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': ' The  Thing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meteors and Meteorites', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Watches and Clocks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rolex SA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accessories (Apparel)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jewels and Jewelry', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-18T13:00:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy Hass', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hass', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58086d1e-ea2c-539d-8002-10945fe4a61f', 'word_count': 179, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58086d1e-ea2c-539d-8002-10945fe4a61f'}, {'abstract': 'Morgan Harper, 38, ran a high-profile primary challenge last year for a congressional seat with the backing of national progressive groups.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/18/us/politics/ohio-senate-morgan-harper-progressive.html', 'snippet': 'Morgan Harper, 38, ran a high-profile primary challenge last year for a congressional seat with the backing of national progressive groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While Republicans are running a hotly competitive primary race for Ohio’s open Senate seat next year, the Democratic side had been owned by a single candidate: Representative Tim Ryan from the Youngstown area.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/us/politics/18political-briefing-ohio-dems/merlin_162541284_5cc6dc78-afc4-4524-a8bb-4644bf9b40e2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/18/us/politics/18political-briefing-ohio-dems/merlin_162541284_5cc6dc78-afc4-4524-a8bb-4644bf9b40e2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/us/politics/18political-briefing-ohio-dems/merlin_162541284_5cc6dc78-afc4-4524-a8bb-4644bf9b40e2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/us/politics/18political-briefing-ohio-dems/merlin_162541284_5cc6dc78-afc4-4524-a8bb-4644bf9b40e2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/18/us/politics/18political-briefing-ohio-dems/18political-briefing-ohio-dems-thumbStanda