 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/18/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-19-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Thursday, Aug. 19, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Wednesday about the history and motives of the Taliban misstated the age of the Great Buddhas of Bamiyan, which the Taliban destroyed in 2001. The statues were about 1,500 years old, not 800.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 19, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-19T02:16:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/90d7d791-06b6-5fa3-a2cf-0622f818d13e', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90d7d791-06b6-5fa3-a2cf-0622f818d13e'}, {'abstract': 'The lower court “committed numerous, reversible legal and factual errors,” according to the U.S. Court of Appeals for the Fifth Circuit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/19/us/abortion-texas-ruling.html', 'snippet': 'The lower court “committed numerous, reversible legal and factual errors,” according to the U.S. Court of Appeals for the Fifth Circuit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal appeals court on Wednesday upheld a Texas law banning the most common form of second-trimester abortion, ruling that a lower court had erred in finding that the law imposed “an undue burden on a large fraction of women.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/reader-center/19xp-Texas-abortion-b/burst-texas-pp-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarg