 the National emerges via his own project with Justin Vernon, Big Red Machine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/19/arts/music/aaron-dessner-big-red-machine.html', 'snippet': 'The “shy” producer and musician from the long-running indie-rock band the National emerges via his own project with Justin Vernon, Big Red Machine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'COLUMBIA COUNTY, N.Y. — Aaron Dessner sat down at the black upright piano in his Long Pond Studio, pressed the soft pedal and played a four-note phrase that had changed his life. It was the first notes — G F E-flat F — of a music file he sent to Taylor Swift in March 2020.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/22/arts/22DESSNER1/merlin_191132274_1927c0f7-c71e-4a72-babe-88d034462fa0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/22/arts/22DESSNER1/merlin_191132274_1927c0f7-c71e-4a72-babe-88d034462fa0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/22/arts/22DESSNER1/merlin_191132274_1927c0f7-c71e-4a72-babe-88d034462fa0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/22/arts/22DESSNER1/merlin_191132274_1927c0f7-c71e-4a72-babe-88d034462fa0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/22/arts/22DESSNER1/22DESSNER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'th