20T03:11:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/10fb8268-99d2-5d06-9ded-331d86e7060c', 'word_count': 41, 'uri': 'nyt://article/10fb8268-99d2-5d06-9ded-331d86e7060c'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 20, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/19/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-20-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, Aug. 20, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Thursday about a new digital tool called Disney Genie that allows line-skipping privileges at Walt Disney World misstated the status of its FastPass service in California in 2017. The park kept FastPass while introducing the MaxPass app; it did not eliminate FastPass that year. In addition, an earlier version of a picture caption with the article misstated the location of the park shown. The photograph was taken at Disneyland Paris, not in the United States.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 20, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-20T03:11:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c866a86-3632-5eb5-a687-efb68b89e256', 'word_count': 129, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c866a86-3632-5eb5-a687-efb68b89e256'}, {'abstract': 'Hiding and hunted by the Taliban.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/19/briefing/taliban-coronavirus-wildfires.html', 'snippet': 'Hiding and hunted by the Taliban.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thousands of Afghan soldiers have fled to countries like Iran and Uzbekistan over the past few weeks as the Taliban rapidly took over. Tens of thousands more are now on the run, hiding and hunted by the Taliban. “There’s no way out,” said one commando, who was hiding in the mountains of eastern Afghanistan. “I am praying to be saved.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces/20-am-briefing-europe-afghan-forces-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/world/20-am-briefing