}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/94369db4-f26d-5653-b8eb-c1c041c98bee', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94369db4-f26d-5653-b8eb-c1c041c98bee'}, {'abstract': 'Prematurely ending federal programs had little effect on employment but sharply cut spending, potentially hurting state economies, researchers say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/20/business/economy/unemployment-benefits-economy-states.html', 'snippet': 'Prematurely ending federal programs had little effect on employment but sharply cut spending, potentially hurting state economies, researchers say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cutoff of federal unemployment benefits in much of the country was meant to bring a flood of workers back to the job market. So far, that flood looks more like a trickle.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/business/benefits-cutoff-promo/benefits-cutoff-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/19/business/benefits-cutoff-promo/benefits-cutoff-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/business/benefits-cutoff-promo/benefits-cutoff-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/business/benefits-cutoff-promo/benefits-cutoff-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 798, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/business/benefits-cutoff-promo/benefits-cu