e43-f2e89ca286a9'}, {'abstract': 'Follow a simple formula for colorful, satisfying dishes that don’t require turning on the oven or stove.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/20/dining/easy-no-cook-dinner-recipes.html', 'snippet': 'Follow a simple formula for colorful, satisfying dishes that don’t require turning on the oven or stove.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Summer’s bounty is so vibrant and delicious on its own, it’s easy and enjoyable to forgo cooking by making the season’s produce the star of a dish. For a meal that’s as satisfying as one that you’ve spent all day cooking, focus on smart shopping and artful assembly. Here’s the formula to commit to memory: Select at least one variety of ripe raw fruit or vegetable, a prepared protein, a starch and seasonings, then combine them into a big salad, a generously topped toast, a hearty dip or an abundant snack tray.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/20no-cook2/merlin_191889447_dcc0061e-0718-4204-b36e-7f04f1420936-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/20no-cook2/merlin_191889447_dcc0061e-0718-4204-b36e-7f04f1420936-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/20no-cook2/merlin_191889447_dcc0061e-0718-4204-b36e-7f04f1420936-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/20no-cook2/merlin_191889447_dcc0061e-0718-4204-b36e-7f04f1420936-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': 