iding little more than $5-a-month connections to homes that otherwise had no access to television.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 602, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 602}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1021, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1097, 'width': 1093, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/21/obituaries/18Hauser2/18Hauser2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Gustave M. Hauser, an Early Force in Cable TV, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gustave M. Hauser, a ‘Visionary’ Who Helped Build Cable TV, Is Dead at 91', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cable Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 4, 'major