 to get vaccinated while more progressive ones, like Pope Francis, arguing in favor of vaccines.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/20/us/covid-vaccine-religious-exemption-philadelphia-catholic-church.html', 'snippet': 'The issue has become a matter of contention within the church, with more conservative church leaders supporting people who choose not to get vaccinated while more progressive ones, like Pope Francis, arguing in favor of vaccines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Archdiocese of Philadelphia said earlier this week that it will not sanction religious exemptions to Covid vaccine mandates, joining a growing chorus of other Catholic dioceses that are declining to give their parishioners an excuse for not getting inoculated.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/20/world/20virus-briefing-philadelphia-catholic-vaccination-b/merlin_192625047_ca534dcc-6d3f-405f-8bd3-ac475734e954-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/20/world/20virus-briefing-philadelphia-catholic-vaccination-b/merlin_192625047_ca534dcc-6d3f-405f-8bd3-ac475734e954-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/20/world/20virus-briefing-philadelphia-catholic-vaccination-b/merlin_192625047_ca534dcc-6d3f-405f-8bd3-ac475734e954-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/20/world/20virus-briefing-philadelphia-catholic-vaccination-b/merlin_192625047_ca534dcc-6d3f-405f-8bd3-ac475734e954-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank':