ur German Cup wins and three European Cup victories in 15 years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/21/sports/soccer/gerd-muller-soccer-star-known-for-his-scoring-prowess-dies-at-75.html', 'snippet': 'He scored 566 goals for Bayern Munich, helping the club to four German titles, four German Cup wins and three European Cup victories in 15 years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gerd Müller, the German soccer star who became known as “Der Bomber” for his scoring prowess, died on Aug. 15 in Wolfratshausen, Germany. He was 75.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/merlin_193296762_31c41b75-7c2d-434f-98f4-74d7b89a46ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/merlin_193296762_31c41b75-7c2d-434f-98f4-74d7b89a46ea-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 448}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/merlin_193296762_31c41b75-7c2d-434f-98f4-74d7b89a46ea-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/merlin_193296762_31c41b75-7c2d-434f-98f4-74d7b89a46ea-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1528, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/21muller-obit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/21/us/21muller-obit1/21muller-obit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbn