e of the last habitats for the critically endangered animal. In the fall of 2015, however, research suggested that the numbers had significantly improved: 2.8 tigers per 100 square kilometers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sunday Read: ‘The Case of the Vanishing Jungle’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'audio-neutral-informative', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coffee', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forests and Forestry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wildlife Conservation Society', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tigers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bukit Barisan Selatan National Park (Sumatra, Indonesia)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Agriculture and Farming', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-22T13:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1ba309a-20de-5684-986c-80fdec1bf283', 'word_count': 248, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1ba309a-20de-5684-986c-80fdec1bf283'}, {'abstract': 'A team of experts, with the help of local residents and authorities, is trying to revive an ancient olive tree in the hilltop village of Cuglieri that was engulfed in a catastrophic wildfire.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/22/world/europe/italy-sardinia-fire-tree.html', 'snippet': 'A team of experts, with the help of local residents and authorities, is trying to revive an ancient olive tree in the hilltop village of Cuglieri that was engulfed in a catastrophic wildfire.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the people of Cuglieri, a small hilltop village on the Itali