a94bee18146'}, {'abstract': 'He rose to leadership in the longshoremen’s union as a polished reformer, but the U.S. called him a Mafia boss, and he served prison time in a racketeering case.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/business/anthony-scotto-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He rose to leadership in the longshoremen’s union as a polished reformer, but the U.S. called him a Mafia boss, and he served prison time in a racketeering case.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anthony M. Scotto, a former leader of the longshoremen’s union whose polished manners and soft-spoken approach made him seem out of place in the turbulent, often corrupt world of the waterfront until he himself went to prison for labor racketeering, has died. He was 87. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/obituaries/23scotto1/merlin_29448139_5a75fc1b-643b-4b21-9cee-5837078e0808-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 780, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/24/obituaries/23scotto1/merlin_29448139_5a75fc1b-643b-4b21-9cee-5837078e0808-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 780}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/obituaries/23scotto1/merlin_29448139_5a75fc1b-643b-4b21-9cee-5837078e0808-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 788, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/obituaries/23scotto1/merlin_29448139_5a75fc1b-643b-4b21-9cee-5837078e0808-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1575, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/obituaries/23s