nization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2cecf2a8-d448-5fb0-8186-a51ae0f26cdd', 'word_count': 134, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2cecf2a8-d448-5fb0-8186-a51ae0f26cdd'}, {'abstract': 'Jake Cohen, the author of “Jew-ish: Reinvented Recipes From a Modern Mensch,” will lead an event at the 92nd Street Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/dining/high-holy-days.html', 'snippet': 'Jake Cohen, the author of “Jew-ish: Reinvented Recipes From a Modern Mensch,” will lead an event at the 92nd Street Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In today’s Covid-racked society, small, carefully orchestrated family gatherings are especially precious during the Jewish High Holy Days. In a virtual program by the 92nd Street Y, Jake Cohen, a chef and the author of “Jew-ish: Reinvented Recipes From a Modern Mensch,” will discuss the importance of family and togetherness for the holidays with Rabbi Samantha Frank, the director of Jewish education at the 92nd Street Y. He will also demonstrate how to make honey-baked Brie with apples.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-class/23burner-class-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Virtual Cooking Class for the High Holy Days', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Learn: Cooking and Family On the High Holy Days', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-23T23:58:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9670d95d-c7f4-5c01-a7ee-275a240c75e0', 'word_count': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9670d95d-c7f4-5c01-a7ee-275a240c75e0'}, {'abstract': 'Gentian root, a centuries-old bittering agent, takes center stage in Gentiana from Top Note, a Milwaukee drink mixer company.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/dining/gentian-root-tonic.html', 'snippet': 'Gentian root, a centuries-old bittering agent, takes center stage in Gentiana from Top Note, a Milwaukee drink mixer company.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Added to bottled soft drinks since the late 19th century, gentian root has a long history as a bittering agent. At Top Note, a drink mixer company founded in Milwaukee by Mary Pellettieri, a craft beer maker, and her business partner, Noah Swanson, gentian takes center stage in Gentiana, a sophisticated new tonic. It’s the first in the company’s Bartender Release series. Lip-smacking on its own, it is excellent with gin or white rum. The pale amber tonic is not as tart as the company’s classic tonic water and more pointedly bitter than its excellent Indian tonic water.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 890}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 691, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1381, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-soda/23burner-soda-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit'