 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Delta Variant', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food and Drug Administration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pfizer Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-24T00:07:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon LaFraniere and Noah Weiland', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'LaFraniere', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Noah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weiland', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9e7f53e2-df3a-5dd8-93b1-5ed0665b339f', 'word_count': 1891, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9e7f53e2-df3a-5dd8-93b1-5ed0665b339f'}, {'abstract': 'In “The Essential Jewish Baking Cookbook,” Beth A. Lee offers an easygoing but detailed book of sweet and savory treats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/dining/the-essential-jewish-baking-cookbook.html', 'snippet': 'In “The Essential Jewish Baking Cookbook,” Beth A. Lee offers an easygoing but detailed book of sweet and savory treats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Beth A. Lee, a food blogger who digs deep into family recipes (her own and others’), has organized some of them into “The Essential Jewish Baking Cookbook,” an easygoing but detailed book of sweets and savories for holidays and every day. Topping the special occasion list is Rosh Hashana, the Jewish New Year, which begins this year — 5782 — at sundown on Sept. 6. Apples are a symbol of the holiday on the Ashkenazi table, and the book features recipes for a cake studded and topped with them and bits of ginger. A very basic challah recipe and the whole-wheat version are included without directions for shaping the bread round, instead of braided, as is customarily done for the holiday. Rather, challah rolls with apple filling make suitable stand-ins, and the dough can be used to make one large loaf. The recipe for pletzel, a Polish specialty that’s also called onion board, deserves to be added to your flatbread collection. The book taps traditions, including those of Sephardic and Mizrachi cultures, in addition to Ashkenazic. It also gives details on making the recipes kosher.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 740, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 740}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 831, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1661, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-book/23burner-book-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Recipes for Rosh Hashana, and for Every Day', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Bake: Sweet and Savory Treats That Suit Every Occasion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jews and Judaism', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-24T00:10:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/649f6fba-eb9a-5258-b87d-d1034f7c7423', 'word_count': 234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/649f6fba-eb9a-5258-b87d-d1034f7c7423'}, {'abstract': 'At least two dozen members of the Proud Boys face federal charges in the U.S. Capitol siege. But on Sunday, members of the group were mobilizing once again in Oregon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/us/proud-boys-enrique-tarrio.html', 'snippet': 'At least two dozen members of the Proud Boys face federal charges in the U.S. Capitol siege. But on Sunday, members of the group were mobilizing once again in Oregon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PORTLAND, Ore. — In the months since the siege at the U.S. Capitol in January, federal investigators have looked closely at the Proud Boys, a far-right nationalist group at the forefront of the riot. Agents have pried into the group’s encrypted messages, pored over video footage of their exploits and built criminal cases against at least two dozen members.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/23/us/23proudboys-6/23proudboys-6-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even Amid a Crackdown, the Proud Boys Are Still Agitating', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Despite Crackdown, Proud Boys ‘Are Here to Stay,’ Leader Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Storming of the US Capitol (Jan, 2021)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Right-Wing Extremism and Alt-Right', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proud Boys', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tarrio, Enrique', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nordean, Ethan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portland (Ore)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-24T00:11:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sergio Olmos, Mike Baker and Alan Feuer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sergio', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Olmos', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Baker', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feuer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5f47197-aa61-5bba-ae60-e4b990ed3ec5', 'word_count': 1341, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5f47197-aa61-5bba-ae60-e4b990ed3ec5'}, {'abstract': 'Let these fair-trade sets from South Africa add a warming glow to your space.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/23/dining/kapula-candles.html', 'snippet': 'Let these fair-trade sets from South Africa add a warming glow to your space.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps you’re starting to do a little entertaining, maybe planning a modest dinner party. To add a beautiful glow to the table are these gilded candles, new to GlobeIn, an online market that features wares from artisans around the world. They’re nine inches tall and come in sets of two for $13, a price at which lighting them and watching them diminish would not be cause for deep regret. The patterns vary. The candles are made by Kapula, a fair-trade company in South Africa that specializes in decorative candles.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 462, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 462}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 852, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 852, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/dining/23burner-candle/23burner-candle-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name