merchants will be able to add a shopping tab to their profiles and link to products within posts on the video app.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/technology/tiktok-shopify.html', 'snippet': 'In a pilot program, merchants will be able to add a shopping tab to their profiles and link to products within posts on the video app.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TikTok and Shopify, the e-commerce platform, said on Tuesday that they were working together to add the ability for consumers to shop directly in the TikTok app for the first time.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/business/24economy-briefing-shopify-print/merlin_172745904_baf90269-9891-4a4d-9e52-14a5dd51fb6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/business/24economy-briefing-shopify-print/merlin_172745904_baf90269-9891-4a4d-9e52-14a5dd51fb6a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/business/24economy-briefing-shopify-print/merlin_172745904_baf90269-9891-4a4d-9e52-14a5dd51fb6a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/business/24economy-briefing-shopify-print/merlin_172745904_baf90269-9891-4a4d-9e52-14a5dd51fb6a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/business/24economy-briefing-shopify-print/24economy-briefing-shopify-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType