 of a recent possible “anomalous health incident” in Hanoi, where she will discuss public health strategies and seek to bolster partnerships in the South China Sea, a crucial piece of President Biden’s strategy to counter the rising economic influence of China.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A report of an unexplained ‘health incident’ in Hanoi delays Harris’s arrival.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Department', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Kamala D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hanoi (Vietnam)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Singapore', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-24T16:46:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Annie Karni and Zolan Kanno-Youngs', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Karni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Zolan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kanno-Youngs', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea9b64cb-e949-59d9-a7b7-d70f23618107', 'word_count': 337, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea9b64cb-e949-59d9-a7b7-d70f23618107'}, {'abstract': 'Punishing the unemployed doesn’t accomplish very much.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/opinion/jobs-unemployment-benefits.html', 'snippet': 'Punishing the unemployed doesn’t accomplish very much.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Friday, as the clock ticked toward 10 a.m., many labor economists were poised at their 