hdrawal will hinge on completing the goal of airlifting all Americans and Afghan allies out of the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Biden said on Tuesday that the United States was on track to end its two-decade military involvement in Afghanistan by his Aug. 31 deadline.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Biden says the U.S. is poised to meet the Afghan withdrawal deadline, at least for now.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-24T16:59:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear, Annie Karni and Eric Schmitt', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3301ec09-c3bb-5c40-9284-f61864856859', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3301ec09-c3bb-5c40-9284-f61864856859'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Watts, who had no taste for the life of a pop idol, was an unflashy but essential presence with the band and brought to it a swinging style.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/arts/music/charlie-watts-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Watts, who had no taste for the life of a pop idol, was an unflashy but essential presence with the band and brought to it a swinging style.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Charlie Watts, whose strong but unflashy drumming powered the Rolling Stones for over 50 years, died on Tuesday in London. He was 80.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlar