ion on Tuesday to witness the frenzied evacuation of Americans and Afghans, infuriating Biden administration officials and prompting Speaker Nancy Pelosi to urge other lawmakers not to follow their example.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two House members secretly flew to Kabul on an unauthorized oversight mission.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Moulton, Seth W', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'MEIJER, PETER', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Afghanistan War (2001- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-25T01:51:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catie Edmondson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Edmondson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b5bc78a-325c-53c3-ab16-9bd4c75b6aba', 'word_count': 365, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b5bc78a-325c-53c3-ab16-9bd4c75b6aba'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Wednesday, Aug. 25, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/pageoneplus/corrections-aug-25-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Wednesday, Aug. 25, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Sunday about the prices hospitals negotiate with private insurers erroneously included a hospital among those that had posted little or no data about their negotiated rates or cash prices. Methodist Hospital (San Antonio) has posted some required information. The article referred incorrectly to the hospital’s response for a request for comment; the requests for comment were mistakenly sent to another hospital with the same name.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: Aug. 25, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-25T02:30:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/1472881f-64a5-530b-903a-106c50db475f', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1472881f-64a5-530b-903a-106c50db475f'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 25, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-hochul-breaks-a-barrier-and-pledges-a-new-era.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Wednesday, August 25, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It is our time to unleash the power of New York’s women. And make sure that any barriers to success and opportunity are eradicated, once and for all.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Hochul Breaks a Barrier and Pledges a New Era', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-08-25T02:30:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/40986f60-22cf-51ed-aa91-5abfff5563b6', 'word_count': 47, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40986f60-22cf-51ed-aa91-5abfff5563b6'}, {'abstract': 'U.S. on track to leave Afghanistan by Aug. 31.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/24/briefing/afghanistan-deadline-unvaccinated-covid-fifa.html', 'snippet': 'U.S. on track to leave Afghanistan by Aug. 31.', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Biden said at the White House that the U.S. was on track for an Aug. 31 departure from Afghanistan, saying he had spoken to military leaders so they would be prepared to “adjust that timetable, should that become necessary.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/merlin_193589862_6c3c21bc-837d-4989-978c-b95d884a1492-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/merlin_193589862_6c3c21bc-837d-4989-978c-b95d884a1492-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/merlin_193589862_6c3c21bc-837d-4989-978c-b95d884a1492-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/merlin_193589862_6c3c21bc-837d-4989-978c-b95d884a1492-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/25ambriefing-europe-nl-afghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25ambriefing-europe-nl-promo/25ambriefing-europe-nl-afghan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25