f of the lower 48 is experiencing drought conditions. Follow here for the latest on extreme weather, including floods, wildfires and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/us/drought.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly half of the lower 48 is experiencing drought conditions. Follow here for the latest on extreme weather, including floods, wildfires and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A 53-foot waterfall in Minneapolis has been reduced to a trickle. Utah’s biggest reservoirs are about half full, and dropping. Almond growers in California are abandoning their dying trees as water grows increasingly scarce.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/us/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/24/us/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/us/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/us/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/24/us/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update/24climate-weather-briefing-drought-update-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 