You’ll find sensible guidance in these books.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the pandemic I fantasized about writing a parenting book. Its title would be: GET OUT OF THE EFFING HOUSE.  But maybe it’s just as well I didn’t, since it seems every other person in America did. There are many, and they are a mixed bag — understandable when you consider the fact that everyone was writing within whining distance of their children. Here are four worth your consideration; you may find them as helpful as curling up with that third glass of afternoon chardonnay.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 525, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 525}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 895, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1052, 'width': 1203, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/12/books/review/05HelpDesk/05HelpDesk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'These Books Remind Us Why Parenting Is a Verb', 'kicker': 'Nonfiction', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Family Matters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fourteen Talks by Age Fourteen: The Essential Conversations You Need to Have with Your Kids Before They Start High School (Book)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Icard, Michelle', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Pops: Learning To Be a Son and a Father (Book)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Melvin, Craig', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Addiction Inoculation: Raising Healthy Kids in a Culture of Dependence (Book)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lahey, Jessica (1970- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'My Everything: The Parent I Want To Be, The Children I Want to Raise (Book)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nathan, Einat', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-25T09:00:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'subsection_name': 'Book Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Judith Newman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Judith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd5ddf0b-51c7-5f24-a1e1-df7dd01e9b97', 'word_count': 956, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd5ddf0b-51c7-5f24-a1e1-df7dd01e9b97'}, {'abstract': 'Other tennis superstars have built sponsorship empires. But none ever wooed the corporate class as brilliantly as Federer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/magazine/roger-federer-brand-legacy.html', 'snippet': 'Other tennis superstars have built sponsorship empires. But none ever wooed the corporate class as brilliantly as Federer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was moving day in the California desert, and Roger Federer was up before dawn. We met on the tarmac in Thermal, a short drive from Indian Wells, where Federer had lost the day before in the final of the 2018 BNP Paribas Open to Juan Martín del Potro. Just the previous month, Federer had capped his remarkable late-career surge by reclaiming the No. 1 ranking for the first time in more than five years. At 36, he was the oldest player to hold the spot since the A.T.P. published its first rankings in 1973. But Indian Wells was a rather disappointing sequel. He served for the title against del Potro at 5-4 in the third set and failed to finish him off despite holding three match points.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/magazine/29mag-federer-1/29mag-federer-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/29/magazine/29mag-federer-1/29mag-federer-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/magazine/29mag-federer-1/29mag-federer-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/magazine/29mag-federer-1/29mag-federer-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 