sing but not mention why that happened.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/opinion/afghanistan-taliban-army.html', 'snippet': 'It pains me to see President Biden and other Western officials blame the Afghan Army for collapsing but not mention why that happened.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For the past three and a half months, I fought day and night, nonstop, in southern Afghanistan’s Helmand Province against an escalating and bloody Taliban offensive. Coming under frequent attack, we held the Taliban back and inflicted heavy casualties. Then I was called to Kabul to command Afghanistan’s special forces. But the Taliban already were entering the city; it was too late.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/opinion/25sadat/merlin_192574980_6b307b17-5f9b-4641-a7db-32d7984ffed5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/26/opinion/25sadat/merlin_192574980_6b307b17-5f9b-4641-a7db-32d7984ffed5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/opinion/25sadat/merlin_192574980_6b307b17-5f9b-4641-a7db-32d7984ffed5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/opinion/25sadat/merlin_192574980_6b307b17-5f9b-4641-a7db-32d7984ffed5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/opinion/25sadat/25sadat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna