movies/bob-ross-happy-accidents-betrayal-greed-review.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary on “The Joy of Painting” star focuses on the controversy over who controls his brand and legacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Ross’s hair was a thing of beauty. When he appeared on “Live! With Regis and Kathie Lee,” Regis Philbin teased him about his Afro, which Ross sweetly admitted might be more nurtured than nature. And photos of Ross as a teenager and then as a young airman rocking a pompadour make clear he always liked a good ’do. This is among the cheerier scenes in the director Joshua Rofé’s “Bob Ross: Happy Accidents, Betrayal & Greed,” a documentary less about Ross’s life than about what happened to his brand in the later years and after his death. Annette and Walt Kowalski, who were Ross’s business partners, are not painted in a flattering light. (The couple declined to participate in the film.)', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/merlin_193438248_a2728795-5e2e-4fd0-96b9-e6005ee2d8ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/merlin_193438248_a2728795-5e2e-4fd0-96b9-e6005ee2d8ed-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/merlin_193438248_a2728795-5e2e-4fd0-96b9-e6005ee2d8ed-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/merlin_193438248_a2728795-5e2e-4fd0-96b9-e6005ee2d8ed-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/25bobross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/25bobross-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/27/arts/25bobross/25bobross-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Bob Ross: Happy Accidents, Betrayal & Greed’ Review: No Gloss', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Painter’s Legacy, Not All of It Joyful', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Bob Ross: Happy Accidents, Betrayal & Greed (Book)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ross, Bob', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Joy of Painting (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Personal Profile', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wills and Estates', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kowalski, Annette', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kowalski, Walt', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rofe, Joshua (Filmmaker)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-25T20:18:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Kennedy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kennedy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/9dad5c26-273b-57d5-8bf1-e49974b33d41', 'word_count': 436, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9dad5c26-273b-57d5-8bf1-e49974b33d41'}, {'abstract': 'Caitlyn Jenner recalls her past as a decathlon champion in this sports documentary directed by Crystal Moselle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/movies/untold-caitlyn-jenner-review.html', 'snippet': 'Caitlyn Jenner recalls her past as a decathlon champion in this sports documentary directed by Crystal Moselle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Caitlyn Jenner is best known as a tabloid celebrity and family member of the Kardashian clan who publicly transitioned as a transgender woman. But “Untold: Caitlyn Jenner” — an episode of the new Netflix documentary series “Untold” that highlights underappreciated stories from sports — illuminates the events that brought Jenner her first taste of international recognition; namely, her gold medal win as a decathlon athlete in the 1976 Montreal Olympics.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/arts/26untold-art/26untold-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/26/arts/26untold-art/26untold-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/arts/26untold-art/26untold-art-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/arts/26untold-art/26untold-art-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1068, 'width': 1898, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac