3fcc-5766-51d0-bcea-6d270ff87aeb'}, {'abstract': 'Rachel Nichols said in a recorded conversation that Maria Taylor, who is Black, was chosen to host 2020 N.B.A. finals coverage because the network “felt pressure” on diversity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/sports/basketball/rachel-nichols-espn.html', 'snippet': 'Rachel Nichols said in a recorded conversation that Maria Taylor, who is Black, was chosen to host 2020 N.B.A. finals coverage because the network “felt pressure” on diversity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ESPN has taken Rachel Nichols off its N.B.A. programming and canceled “The Jump,” the daily basketball show she has hosted for five years, the network confirmed Wednesday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/sports/25espn-nichols/merlin_191193195_381f66cd-f4a3-4650-bf81-4b4edf91c7fb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/sports/25espn-nichols/merlin_191193195_381f66cd-f4a3-4650-bf81-4b4edf91c7fb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/sports/25espn-nichols/merlin_191193195_381f66cd-f4a3-4650-bf81-4b4edf91c7fb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/sports/25espn-nichols/merlin_191193195_381f66cd-f4a3-4650-bf81-4b4edf91c7fb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/sports/25espn-nichols/merlin_191193195_381f66c