some populations have extremely limited access to vaccines, public health agencies are taking control of the means of production.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/25/world/americas/who-to-manufacture-vaccines-latin-america.html', 'snippet': 'In a region where some populations have extremely limited access to vaccines, public health agencies are taking control of the means of production.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To help address unequal access to Covid-19 vaccines around the world — an issue that “remains the Achilles’ heel” of the pandemic fight —\xa0 the World Health Organization is starting a program to manufacture vaccines in Latin America and the Caribbean, Dr. Carissa Etienne, the director of the Pan American Health Organization, said Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25virus-briefing-PAHO-new/merlin_193248726_b5968475-8678-48ac-8cbc-4214ef2c56b7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25virus-briefing-PAHO-new/merlin_193248726_b5968475-8678-48ac-8cbc-4214ef2c56b7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25virus-briefing-PAHO-new/merlin_193248726_b5968475-8678-48ac-8cbc-4214ef2c56b7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/us/25virus-briefing-PAHO-new/merlin_193248726_b5968475-8678-48ac-8cbc-4214ef2c56b7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/