'The authorities are responding to a wave of gun violence. But their anti-gang tactics have long faced criticism for unfairly targeting young Black people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A father was wounded while shielding his three children from gunfire at a car dealership. A teacher was killed on a morning dog walk when a gunman missed his target. And a baby in his stroller was mortally wounded when two men opened fire on a nighttime cookout.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/merlin_191846355_af7b1bbd-a724-4367-9a0f-dad9917fc834-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/merlin_191846355_af7b1bbd-a724-4367-9a0f-dad9917fc834-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/merlin_191846355_af7b1bbd-a724-4367-9a0f-dad9917fc834-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/merlin_191846355_af7b1bbd-a724-4367-9a0f-dad9917fc834-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/00nygangbusts03-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/19/nyregion/00nygangbusts03/00nygangbusts03-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra