ring and certainly more prized commodity than affordable housing.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/25/arts/00candyman/merlin_193413060_88a2d5ff-76fc-4449-bee1-68c6546c2ebb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Candyman’ Review: Who Can Take a Sunr