': 'Backed by Nine Inch Nails, Halsey Connects Past and Future', 'kicker': 'Album Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Past and Future Are Connected by Nails', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frangipane, Ashley Nicolette (Halsey)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': "If I Can't Have Love, I Want Power (Album)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nine Inch Nails (Music Group)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-26T13:17:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Pareles', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pareles', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d1d86be-191c-5971-9a91-7d083bbfa01d', 'word_count': 743, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d1d86be-191c-5971-9a91-7d083bbfa01d'}, {'abstract': 'The wine country town of Healdsburg is offering residents treated wastewater for their yards.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/26/us/healdsburg-drought-wastewater.html', 'snippet': 'The wine country town of Healdsburg is offering residents treated wastewater for their yards.', 'lead_paragraph': ' ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/26/us/26californiatoday-promo/merlin_193411905_9ca0970b-7da0-4e36-a083-b08dfb53bb96-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/26/us/26californiatoday-promo/merlin_193411905_9ca0970b-7da0-4e36-a083-b08dfb53bb96-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'r