th a peppery stew and a fresh take on peach Melba round out David Tanis’s late-season menu.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/27/dining/summer-menu-ideas.html', 'snippet': 'A creamy corn soup, chicken with a peppery stew and a fresh take on peach Melba round out David Tanis’s late-season menu.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The weather is warm, but the sun sets earlier, the surest sign that summer is nearly over. At my local market, the year’s last corn is piled high, and there are big baskets of shapely sweet peppers in every hue. It seems quite wonderful that stone fruits are still around — peaches, nectarines and plums.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tanis1/merlin_193478295_ec0bff2a-cd5c-4370-b87e-dcdb81292bf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tanis1/merlin_193478295_ec0bff2a-cd5c-4370-b87e-dcdb81292bf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tanis1/merlin_193478295_ec0bff2a-cd5c-4370-b87e-dcdb81292bf3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tanis1/merlin_193478295_ec0bff2a-cd5c-4370-b87e-dcdb81292bf3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tanis1/27Tanis1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/09/01/dining/27Tani