eit subpar Scrabble player,” according to the print puzzle introduction (could be that he’s just modest, hm). This is his second grid for The Times (after a Wednesday with international puns), and his Sunday debut.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/merlin_80273623_3a98b075-51b4-4a4b-86c4-deaa3f458514-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/merlin_80273623_3a98b075-51b4-4a4b-86c4-deaa3f458514-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/merlin_80273623_3a98b075-51b4-4a4b-86c4-deaa3f458514-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/merlin_80273623_3a98b075-51b4-4a4b-86c4-deaa3f458514-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/29wordplay-intercom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/29wordplay-intercom-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/crosswords/29wordplay-intercom/29wordplay-intercom-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarg