607, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6d3cd3c1-6371-5a04-b156-d6a0b6ae783a'}, {'abstract': 'The U.S. mission to Afghanistan will likely open in a country elsewhere in the region.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/29/world/afghanistan-usa-diplomats.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S. mission to Afghanistan will likely open in a country elsewhere in the region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States is unlikely to keep diplomats in Afghanistan after the U.S. military departs on Tuesday, Secretary of State Antony J. Blinken said on Sunday, ending a 20-year mission of one of the largest American embassies in the world.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/world/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken/merlin_193318089_71442a13-2232-4c35-a085-3cb876ce41e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/29/world/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken/merlin_193318089_71442a13-2232-4c35-a085-3cb876ce41e5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/world/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken/merlin_193318089_71442a13-2232-4c35-a085-3cb876ce41e5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/world/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken/merlin_193318089_71442a13-2232-4c35-a085-3cb876ce41e5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/29/world/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken/29afghanistan-briefing-blinken-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 