 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/29/business/media/politico-robert-allbritton.html', 'snippet': 'From “son of” to mogul in his own right: Robert Allbritton just became the unlikeliest winner of the new media sweepstakes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was sitting in a bar next to John Harris, a former national editor of The Washington Post. It was late in 2006, and he was recruiting me for a new project, a superblog called The Politico. I was interested, but I had a few questions about the owner. I had never heard of Robert Allbritton and I asked if he’d be the kind of billionaire publisher who wanted to see his own column on the front page, or if he’d be the other kind of wealthy owner, a dilettante who gets quickly bored with his new plaything.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/business/29BenSmith1-print/merlin_193759434_f3478d0d-d21d-4ffb-93c3-843ea4c4a292-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/30/business/29BenSmith1-print/merlin_193759434_f3478d0d-d21d-4ffb-93c3-843ea4c4a292-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/business/29BenSmith1-print/merlin_193759434_f3478d0d-d21d-4ffb-93c3-843ea4c4a292-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/business/29BenSmith1-print/merlin_193759434_f3478d0d-d21d-4ffb-93c3-843ea4c4a292-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima