cle are showing off new restaurants with tons of outdoor dining, shops and galleries.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/31/travel/washington-dc-city-guide.html', 'snippet': 'In the nation’s capital, the walkable neighborhoods of Logan Circle, West End/Foggy Bottom and Dupont Circle are showing off new restaurants with tons of outdoor dining, shops and galleries.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whether they work on or off Capitol Hill, Washingtonians tend to plan their summer schedules around that of Congress, meaning that during the weeks preceding the lawmakers’ return (this year beginning in mid-September), the nation’s capital is far less crowded than usual. For visitors, a largely empty city means the possibility of scoring reservations at the most exclusive restaurants and strolling past the glowing Lincoln Memorial at night without joggers ruining your photo op.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/31/travel/31city-series-washington-dc-1/merlin_193395927_087d7c12-8d0d-4c58-a6e7-0c0cc404c8dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/31/travel/31city-series-washington-dc-1/merlin_193395927_087d7c12-8d0d-4c58-a6e7-0c0cc404c8dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/31/travel/31city-series-washington-dc-1/merlin_193395927_087d7c12-8d0d-4c58-a6e7-0c0cc404c8dd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/31/travel/31city-series-washington-dc-1/merlin_193395927_087d7c12-8d0d-4c58-a6e7-0c0cc404c8dd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'cr