leg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9a872d2-04be-536b-a1ca-ddd8ea7e37de', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9a872d2-04be-536b-a1ca-ddd8ea7e37de'}, {'abstract': 'The aftermath of Hurricane Ida presented problems to some of the state’s hospitals, particularly in the shadow of the Covid-19 pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/31/us/ida-brings-more-challenges-for-louisiana-hospitals-already-struggling-with-a-covid-surge.html', 'snippet': 'The aftermath of Hurricane Ida presented problems to some of the state’s hospitals, particularly in the shadow of the Covid-19 pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After Hurricane Ida lashed Louisiana on Sunday, hospitals in the storm’s path were assessing building damage, bracing for storm-related injuries and determining how to continue Covid-19 care this week, all while being forced to run on generators for at least several days.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/us/30virus-brief-hospital-ida/30virus-brief-hospital-ida-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/30/us/30virus-brief-hospital-ida/30virus-brief-hospital-ida-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/us/30virus-brief-hospital-ida/30virus-brief-hospital-ida-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/30/us/30virus-brief-hospital-ida/30virus-brief-hospital-ida-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJ