. How did it happen and what’s next?', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Monday night, after a 20-year war that claimed 170,000 lives, cost over $2 trillion and did not defeat the Taliban, the United States completed its withdrawal from Afghanistan. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'America’s Final Hours in Afghanistan', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'audio-neutral-informative', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Taliban', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'AFGHANISTAN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-08-31T10:02:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Podcasts', 'section_name': 'Podcasts', 'subsection_name': 'The Daily', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Barbaro, Clare Toeniskoetter, Annie Brown, Stella Tan, Paige Cowett and Marion Lozano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barbaro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Clare', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Toeniskoetter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brown', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}, {'firstname': 'Stella', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 4}, {'firstname': 'Paige', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 5}, {'firstname': 'Marion', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lozano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 6}], 