erg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b40ddee8-cc40-540c-acb1-973bf866375b', 'word_count': 811, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b40ddee8-cc40-540c-acb1-973bf866375b'}, {'abstract': 'Roberto Wagner Fernandes, who died in a plane crash in Paraguay in 2005, killed three women whose bodies were found in Miami and Broward County in 2000 and 2001, the authorities said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/08/31/us/miami-serial-killer-cold-case-dna.html', 'snippet': 'Roberto Wagner Fernandes, who died in a plane crash in Paraguay in 2005, killed three women whose bodies were found in Miami and Broward County in 2000 and 2001, the authorities said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A man who died in a plane crash in Paraguay in 2005 was responsible for the deaths of three women whose killings in South Florida remained unsolved for two decades, the authorities said Tuesday, citing advances in crime-scene technology and years of detective work across two continents.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/31/us/31xp-coldcase-2/merlin_193962678_415815c7-5688-4409-8527-a99f161f447f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 285, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/08/31/us/31xp-coldcase-2/merlin_193962678_415815c7-5688-4409-8527-a99f161f447f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 285}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/08/31/us/31xp-coldcase-2/merlin_193962678_415815c7-5688-4409-8527-a99f161f447f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, '